{"id":"normalement","lemma":"normalement","pos":"adv","rank":1763,"glosses":["in theory","usually (most of the time)","normally"],"ipa":"/nɔʁ.mal.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d2/Fr-normalement.ogg/Fr-normalement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Normalement, je vais à pied.","en":"I usually go on foot.","words":[null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"on foot"]]},{"text":"Normalement, je dors tard.","en":"Normally, I sleep late.","words":[null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to sleep","l":"dormir"},{"g":"late"}]},{"text":"Il est normalement chez lui le soir.","en":"He is generally at home in the evening.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"evening"}]},{"text":"Je ne fais pas cela, normalement.","en":"I don't normally do that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"that"},null]},{"text":"Combien d'heures travailles-tu normalement ?","en":"How many hours do you normally work?","words":[{"g":"how much"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"hour, time","l":"heure"},{"g":"to work","l":"travailler"},{"g":"you"},null]}]}